Pack Horizon's reference engine (engine/reference/blast_lfp.py) is a re-implementation, in vectorised form, of the
two lithium iron phosphate degradation models in NREL's BLAST-Lite:

  Lfp_Gr_250AhPrismatic          (models/lfp_gr_250AhPrismatic_2019.py)
  Lfp_Gr_SonyMurata3Ah_Battery   (models/lfp_gr_SonyMurata3Ah_2018.py)

together with its graphite half-cell potential function and its power-law, sigmoid and power-B state updates
(models/degradation_model.py). The fitted parameter values and the equations come from BLAST-Lite.
Source: https://github.com/NatLabRockies/BLAST-Lite (formerly NREL/BLAST-Lite), version 1.1.3.

